/5968958.png\"></noscript>\n        <span>X</span>\n    </div>\n    <a href=\"https://x.com/srofficial2012\" class=\"social-btn\">Follow</a>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div id=\"v-sarkariresult\"></div>\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-48617a69 gb-headline-text\"><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; height: 2011px;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 248px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 95.0234%; height: 248px;\" colspan=\"10\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Uttar Pradesh Madhyamic Shiksha Parishad (UPMSP)</b></span><b></b></h2>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>UP Board Class 10th, 12th Improvement &amp; Compartment Exam 2026</strong></span></h2>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>UPMSP Exam 2026 : Short Details of Notification</b></span></h2>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><b></b></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 199px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 48.6924%; height: 199px;\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span><b></b></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Improvement / Compartment Application Begin : <strong>06/06/2026</strong></li>\n<li>Last Date for Apply Online : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><b>27/06/2026</b></span></li>\n<li>Pay Exam Fee Last Date : <b>27/06/2026</b></li>\n<li>Improvement / Compartment Result Available : <strong>As per Schedule</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 46.3311%; height: 199px;\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span><b></b></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Class 10th High School : <strong>256.50/-</strong></li>\n<li>12th Compartment Exam : <b>306/-</b></li>\n<li>Pay the Exam Fee Through E Challan Fee Mode Only.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 257px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 95.0234%; height: 257px;\" colspan=\"10\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>UP Board Class 10th Improvement / Compartment Exam 2026</b></span><b></b></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Uttar Pradesh Board High School Class 10 Improvement / Compartment Exam 2026 Eligibility :</li>\n<li><strong>UPMSP Class 10th Improvement Exam Eligibility :</strong>&nbsp;candidates can apply for only one subject in which they have failed.</li>\n<li><strong>UPMSP Class 10th Compartment Exam Eligibility :</strong>&nbsp;candidates can appear and apply for the examination in any one of the two subjects in which they have failed.</li>\n<li>The application process for Uttar Pradesh Board High School Compartment and Improvement Exam 2026 will have to be done online, the main date of which is<strong> 06 June to 27 June 2026.</strong><br>\nTo apply, the prescribed fee of <strong>Rs 256.50/-</strong> has to be paid through challan.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 299px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 95.0234%; height: 299px;\" colspan=\"10\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>UPMSP UP Board Class 12 Intermediate Improvement Compartment Exam 2026 :</b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>UPMSP Class 12th Intermediate Compartment Exam Eligibility :</strong>&nbsp;Candidates appearing in Humanities, Science and Commerce streams can apply in any one subject in Compartmental Examination. Candidates who fail in any one paper of the subjects prescribed in Agriculture Part 01 and 02 and in any one paper of trade subject of Vocational stream will be considered eligible to appear in Compartmental Examination.</li>\n<li>The application process for Uttar Pradesh Board Intermediate Compartment Exam 2026 will have to be done online, the main date of which is<strong> 06 June to 27 June 2026.</strong><br>\nTo apply, the prescribed fee of <strong>Rs 306/-</strong> has to be paid through challan.</li>\n<li>More Eligibility Details Read the Notification</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 376px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 95.0234%; height: 376px;\" colspan=\"10\">\n\n<ul>\n<li>Uttar Pradesh Madhyamik Shiksha Parishad (UPMSP) Examination 2026. Notification and Invited Online Application Form for the UP Board Compartment / Improvement Exam 2026 Candidate Can Apply Online for <b>06/06/2026 to 27/06/2026.</b></li>\n<li>Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the UP Board Latest Examination 2026 Application Form</li>\n<li>Kindly Check and Collect the All Document – Hand Writing, Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</li>\n<li>Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form – Photo, Sign, ID, Thumb, Proof, Etc.</li>\n<li>Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</li>\n<li>If Candidate Required to Paying the Application Fee Must Submit. If You have Not the Required Application Fees Your Form is Not Completed.</li>\n<li>Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</li>\n<li>For the latest updates on Sarkari Result, admit card, answer key, and result, always visit SarkariResult.com, the official website for Sarkari Result in India (Since 2012).</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 62px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 95.0234%; height: 62px;\" colspan=\"10\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Interested Candidate Can Read the Full Notification Before Apply Online.</b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 146px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 95.0234%; height: 146px;\" colspan=\"10\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 62px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 48.6924%; height: 62px;\" colspan=\"5\">\n\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 46.3311%; height: 62px;\" colspan=\"5\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 62px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 95.0234%; text-align: center; height: 62px;\" colspan=\"10\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Some Useful Important Links</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 62px;\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 48.6924%; height: 62px;\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Apply Onlin