nd=\"592\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>4. UP Board Compartment / Improvement Exam Vigyapti PDF?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"655\">Candidates can download the Vigyapti through SarkariResult.com.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left;\" data-section-id=\"kyy6a2\" data-start=\"180\" data-end=\"221\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><strong>5. UP Board Compartment / Improvement Exam Last Date?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-start=\"222\" data-end=\"305\">The last date to apply online is <strong>27 June 2026..</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left;\" data-section-id=\"1dih1sd\" data-start=\"307\" data-end=\"359\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>6. What is the last date to Pay Exam fee Details?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-start=\"360\" data-end=\"433\">Candidates can pay the application fee up to <strong data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"758\">27 June 2026</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left;\" data-section-id=\"o0mtqe\" data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"592\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><strong>7. How can I apply for UP Board Compartment / Improvement Exam?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"655\">Candidates can apply online through the official recruitment link available on <strong data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1334\">SarkariResult.com (Since 2012) – Official Website of Sarkari Result®</strong>.</li>\n<li data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"655\">\n<p></p><figure id=\"attachment_22729\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-22729\" style=\"width: 1487px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-22729 size-full\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201497%20983'%3E%3C/svg%3E\" alt=\"UP Board Compartment / Improvement Exam 2026\" width=\"1497